# Claritty automation — see CLAUDE.md for the full authoring contract.

- intelligence.yaml is the source of truth; the runtime validates it at boot.
- Tools act (@tool, no model calls); agents decide (promptFile, no execute()).
- Every tool an agent may call must be named in its prompt, or it is never called.
- Reach external services only via ctx.integration("<id>") — never an env var key.
- The host fires triggers; the automation runs no scheduler of its own.
- Run `claritty-seed-verify .` after every change.
